WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:47.920 --> 01:49.560
I don't know the whole story

01:49.640 --> 01:50.800
about my lord's patricide.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.680
I just know it had to do

01:52.760 --> 01:54.680
with the forbidden technique
to remove emotions.

01:55.840 --> 01:57.520
It is contained
in an ancient mystique book

01:57.600 --> 01:58.520
and is hard to perform.

01:59.120 --> 02:00.920
So far, only my lord has succeeded in it.

02:02.640 --> 02:04.440
An ancient mystique book?

02:05.280 --> 02:06.720
Do you know where it is now?

02:07.440 --> 02:08.600
Can you take me to see it?

02:08.680 --> 02:10.039
I want to know what is in it.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.960
It's in the former Moon Supreme's chamber.

02:14.040 --> 02:15.240
But…

02:17.480 --> 02:18.760
it has been burned to ashes.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.640
Orchid.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.080
Fairy.

02:48.160 --> 02:49.400
You really shouldn't go in.

02:49.480 --> 02:50.600
My lord has said

02:50.680 --> 02:52.440
the chamber of the former lord
are forbidden.

02:52.520 --> 02:53.600
No one is allowed to enter.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.240
Otherwise,

02:55.320 --> 02:57.480
they would be tortured and executed.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.720
Orchid, do you hear that?

02:59.800 --> 03:00.840
You must not enter.

03:00.920 --> 03:02.600
Besides, Black Dragon has said

03:02.680 --> 03:04.840
that the book was burned to ashes.

03:04.920 --> 03:06.600
It's no use even if you find it.

03:06.680 --> 03:07.760
Let's go back.

03:08.320 --> 03:09.240
Jieli.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.480
I must go.

03:12.600 --> 03:13.800
What you don't know is that

03:14.440 --> 03:16.080
my lord has always been protective of you.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.240
But this is a different case.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.280
In my 38,000 years of serving my lord,

03:20.800 --> 03:22.440
I've never seen anyone survive

03:22.520 --> 03:23.640
after angering my lord

03:23.720 --> 03:25.760
because of the former Moon Supreme.

03:28.880 --> 03:29.880
The former Moon Supreme

03:31.040 --> 03:32.840
is my lord's biggest sore spot.

03:34.520 --> 03:35.840
All the more reason for me to go.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.040
Orchid.

03:38.120 --> 03:39.560
Since it has been a sore spot

03:39.640 --> 03:40.920
for millennia,

03:41.400 --> 03:43.200
then it must bother him all the time.

03:43.920 --> 03:45.760
I must find out the reason

03:45.840 --> 03:46.840
and the right medicine

03:46.920 --> 03:48.240
to cure his wounds

03:48.320 --> 03:50.000
so that he can sleep at night.

03:51.320 --> 03:52.680
Orchid, come back now.

03:52.760 --> 03:53.760
Do you want to die?

03:53.840 --> 03:55.480
Aren't you always the timidest?

03:56.440 --> 03:57.640
You two should go back.

03:57.720 --> 03:59.040
Don't worry about me.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.600
This is none of your business.

04:00.680 --> 04:02.320
If the lord
is to hold someone accountable,

04:02.400 --> 04:03.960
just say you haven't seen me.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.040
Black Dragon, go and stop her.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.600
Let's force her to leave.

04:10.880 --> 04:11.800
Fairy Orchid.

04:12.680 --> 04:13.640
I'll go with you.

04:14.560 --> 04:15.560
This chamber is so big.

04:16.079 --> 04:17.079
You need help searching.

04:17.839 --> 04:19.440
I also want to share my lord's worries.

04:19.519 --> 04:20.720
I'll die with no regrets.

04:22.240 --> 04:24.240
Why have you both lost your minds?

04:33.320 --> 04:34.880
The lord has always disliked me.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.800
If they die,

04:37.400 --> 04:38.840
I'm sure I won't survive either.

04:43.040 --> 04:43.960
Wait for me!

04:45.000 --> 04:46.160
Wait for me!

07:12.640 --> 07:13.560
Good.

07:14.320 --> 07:16.080
My lord will surely love it.

07:36.400 --> 07:37.760
How many hours have you spent

07:39.080 --> 07:41.560
learning this song?

07:44.200 --> 07:45.080
Father,

07:45.720 --> 07:46.720
more than a month.

07:48.800 --> 07:49.840
Are you

07:51.120 --> 07:52.840
the young lord of the Moon Tribe

07:53.600 --> 07:56.040
or are you just an entertainer?

07:56.720 --> 07:58.920
How could you waste your time like this?

08:00.440 --> 08:01.600
I carved this ice zither

08:02.640 --> 08:05.080
for you as a congratulatory gift.

08:05.160 --> 08:08.680
I don't need such a frivolous gift.

08:15.800 --> 08:16.960
Who taught him

08:17.560 --> 08:19.840
to carve wood, play the zither

08:20.440 --> 08:21.920
and play around with him?

08:48.920 --> 08:50.640
Execute them all.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.600
- No!
- Spare my life, Moon Supreme!

08:52.680 --> 08:54.600
- Spare me!
- No! I asked Ms. Wu to teach me.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.280
Don't kill Ms. Wu, please!

09:03.920 --> 09:04.840
Let's go.

09:04.920 --> 09:06.200
- Stop it!
- Spare my life!

09:06.280 --> 09:07.640
- No one can touch her!
- Let's go.

09:07.720 --> 09:08.680
Spare my life!

09:08.760 --> 09:09.840
Ms. Wu!

09:09.920 --> 09:11.280
- Young lord!
- Young lord.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.520
- Young lord!
- Ms. Wu!

09:12.600 --> 09:15.400
- Young lord!
- Young lord!

09:17.320 --> 09:18.400
Young lord.

09:21.720 --> 09:24.120
Ms. Wu!

09:25.200 --> 09:26.120
Young lord.

09:26.200 --> 09:27.560
- Young lord!
- Ms. Wu!

09:27.640 --> 09:29.160
- Ms. Wu!
- Young lord!

09:32.960 --> 09:34.120
Young lord!

09:57.880 --> 10:00.720
Why don't you kill me?

10:02.360 --> 10:03.920
You are my father.

10:14.200 --> 10:15.640
You're such a coward.

10:16.320 --> 10:18.600
When will you master Hellfire?

10:18.680 --> 10:19.880
Again!

11:00.960 --> 11:06.240
NON-ABIDANCE CAVE, CANGYAN SEA

12:26.280 --> 12:28.840
Black Dragon, have you found it yet?

12:30.600 --> 12:31.600
Not yet.

12:31.680 --> 12:34.360
See? Maybe it's not here at all.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.480
Let's go back.

12:39.040 --> 12:40.200
Orchid.

12:42.360 --> 12:43.440
Orchid.

12:44.960 --> 12:46.080
Orchid.

12:52.920 --> 12:54.400
There is one last place left.

13:06.640 --> 13:08.040
Former Moon Supreme,

13:08.720 --> 13:09.640
please forgive me.

14:05.280 --> 14:06.520
I've seen this before.

14:07.040 --> 14:09.040
This is the box that contained the book.

14:17.800 --> 14:19.480
It really was burned to ashes.

14:20.800 --> 14:21.800
Why would I lie to you?

14:22.760 --> 14:23.600
See?

14:23.680 --> 14:25.000
It was a waste of time.

14:32.440 --> 14:33.280
Wait a minute.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.760
This mystique book

14:37.840 --> 14:39.280
is made of wood, isn't it?

14:40.640 --> 14:41.720
Yes, it is.

14:41.800 --> 14:43.520
Since it's made from wood,

14:43.600 --> 14:45.200
maybe I can restore it.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.000
I'll try.

15:47.480 --> 15:48.360
Father.

15:48.960 --> 15:51.200
Please kill me.

15:51.800 --> 15:54.520
I can't take it anymore.

15:58.520 --> 16:01.080
As long as you still have your emotions,

16:02.520 --> 16:05.000
you shall not leave this formation!

16:12.320 --> 16:13.440
Let me ask you.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.800
Have you forgotten

16:17.680 --> 16:18.560
romantic love?

16:24.600 --> 16:26.160
Have you forgotten

16:26.960 --> 16:27.920
brotherly love?

16:33.000 --> 16:34.280
Have you forgotten

16:36.480 --> 16:37.520
parental love?

16:43.840 --> 16:44.720
Then…

16:46.160 --> 16:47.320
what do you remember?

16:49.320 --> 16:51.760
The vow to revive the Moon Tribe.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.440
To crush Shuiyuntian.

17:00.560 --> 17:01.440
Good.

17:05.720 --> 17:06.839
Very well.

17:12.680 --> 17:16.160
Only one more step to go.

17:47.800 --> 17:50.720
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.600
Kill me.

18:33.360 --> 18:36.560
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.

18:36.640 --> 18:39.800
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.
- Greetings, new Moon Supreme.

18:58.840 --> 18:59.720
I never thought

19:01.960 --> 19:03.360
it would be so painful

19:04.680 --> 19:06.080
to remove all emotions.

19:10.360 --> 19:11.280
Orchid.

19:12.400 --> 19:13.280
I understand now.

19:15.800 --> 19:18.480
My lord has been
so pained and irritable lately.

19:20.080 --> 19:22.360
It must be because
his Seven Emotions Tree is regenerating.

19:23.040 --> 19:25.080
His childhood memories are coming back.

19:27.800 --> 19:29.600
He will never forgive his father.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.840
I don't understand

19:33.280 --> 19:36.400
why a father
would treat his son like this.

19:37.640 --> 19:38.480
Didn't he

19:40.800 --> 19:44.240
love his child at all?

19:45.400 --> 19:46.840
That seems to be the case.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.840
No wonder the lord hates him so much.

19:55.920 --> 19:56.960
I don't believe it.

19:58.760 --> 20:00.240
There must be more to the story.

20:02.720 --> 20:03.880
Orchid.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.880
Orchid.

20:05.640 --> 20:06.480
Wait.

20:26.840 --> 20:29.240
Orchid, come on.

20:29.320 --> 20:31.080
Are you done?

20:31.160 --> 20:33.000
Let's leave.
Do you want us all to get killed?

20:38.360 --> 20:40.200
Fairy Orchid, forget it.

20:40.840 --> 20:42.280
It has been more than 30,000 years.

20:42.360 --> 20:43.440
You won't find anything.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.840
My lord and his father
had such a deep grudge.

20:45.920 --> 20:47.280
This is not something we can undo.

20:50.600 --> 20:51.480
I found it.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.600
Look here.

21:03.240 --> 21:05.240
"From Qingcang to Father."

21:05.320 --> 21:07.760
This is a gift
from Dongfang Qingcang to his father.

21:09.760 --> 21:10.600
And here.

21:11.640 --> 21:13.480
This zither was once split in half,

21:13.560 --> 21:15.440
then it was carefully repaired again.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.760
A zither that was no longer useful

21:18.320 --> 21:20.400
was still placed
in the cabinet closest to the bed.

21:21.840 --> 21:23.000
Isn't this a sign

21:23.080 --> 21:25.080
that this father cherished this gift?

21:31.040 --> 21:32.160
And this wooden ball.

21:32.640 --> 21:34.160
It's a child's toy.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.680
I've heard
from the older people in the palace.

21:37.280 --> 21:39.960
Dongfang Qingcang liked to play
with wooden balls as a child.

21:40.040 --> 21:41.320
But Xunfeng didn't like it.

21:42.120 --> 21:44.040
This wooden ball was with the zither.

21:44.840 --> 21:46.800
The child's toys are still well kept.

21:48.320 --> 21:49.520
Doesn't this also show

21:49.600 --> 21:51.640
that the father loved his son very much?

21:57.360 --> 21:58.840
It's a scroll

21:58.920 --> 22:00.480
for the Moon Supreme's close attendant

22:00.560 --> 22:02.680
to record his every word and action.

22:03.360 --> 22:06.080
It should have been in the treasury.

22:06.160 --> 22:07.320
But the former Moon Supreme

22:07.400 --> 22:09.360
hid it in a secret crevice
of this chamber.

22:10.680 --> 22:12.760
I think there must be a secret in this.

22:17.880 --> 22:18.760
Shangque.

22:23.040 --> 22:24.480
"In the middle of the fourth month,

22:24.560 --> 22:28.600
the lord tried the Hellfire Sword
with Qingcang and Xunfeng.

22:29.720 --> 22:31.520
Xunfeng was no match for Hellfire,

22:31.600 --> 22:33.600
instantly failing to wield the sword.

22:34.480 --> 22:36.680
Qingcang wielded the sword with ease.

22:37.320 --> 22:38.920
He is the best among the Moon Tribe

22:39.480 --> 22:40.960
aside from Lady Yan."

22:43.960 --> 22:44.920
And then?

22:45.880 --> 22:48.880
The reason
the former lord hid this chronicle

22:49.880 --> 22:52.440
was because he didn't want others

22:52.520 --> 22:54.000
to know that Dongfang Qingcang

22:54.080 --> 22:56.280
was the only person
who could use the Hellfire Sword.

22:57.800 --> 23:00.120
Dongfang Qingcang once told me

23:00.200 --> 23:01.720
that anyone who wants to use Hellfire

23:03.000 --> 23:04.680
must first be gifted

23:05.320 --> 23:06.960
and second, be devoid of all emotion.

23:07.840 --> 23:09.080
In all three realms,

23:09.960 --> 23:12.040
only Lady Yan and he were qualified.

23:15.560 --> 23:16.600
Back then,

23:17.760 --> 23:20.200
Lady Yan was betrayed
by Chonghua of Shuiyuntian.

23:20.960 --> 23:23.160
She mastered Hellfire
by ridding herself of all emotion.

23:25.720 --> 23:27.560
While Dongfang Qingcang…

23:28.400 --> 23:31.000
Even when he found out
that I am the gifted talent

23:31.080 --> 23:33.040
who's the only one
that can master Hellfire,

23:33.120 --> 23:35.160
he never smiled at me once.

23:35.240 --> 23:37.560
He even looked at me and said,

23:38.960 --> 23:40.560
"Why you?"

23:45.480 --> 23:46.680
What's the matter with you?

23:50.400 --> 23:52.600
I just feel sad all of a sudden.

23:53.840 --> 23:55.440
The moment the former lord found out

23:56.480 --> 23:59.360
that Dongfang Qingcang
could wield the Hellfire Sword,

24:00.000 --> 24:01.440
he must have been very sad.

24:02.800 --> 24:04.680
It was his most beloved son.

24:05.280 --> 24:07.240
But in order to master Hellfire

24:07.320 --> 24:09.120
and restore Cangyan Sea,

24:09.200 --> 24:10.480
he had to remove all emotion

24:10.560 --> 24:11.960
and suffer every pain.

24:12.800 --> 24:15.600
That's why he looked
at Dongfang Qingcang and said,

24:17.960 --> 24:19.320
"Why you?"

24:20.880 --> 24:23.280
Only he knew what he was thinking.

24:23.360 --> 24:24.600
You can only guess.

24:26.960 --> 24:28.800
Only he knew.

24:31.560 --> 24:32.400
Jieli.

24:33.320 --> 24:34.520
You're so smart.

24:47.840 --> 24:48.800
Orchid.

24:49.400 --> 24:51.080
You said you would ask him in person.

24:54.040 --> 24:55.920
Are you going to the bottom
of Oblivion River?

24:57.520 --> 24:58.440
That's right.

24:58.520 --> 24:59.360
After dying,

24:59.440 --> 25:01.160
our spirits rest
in the Return to Ruin Realm

25:01.240 --> 25:02.400
at the bottom of Oblivion River.

25:02.480 --> 25:03.640
I just have to go there

25:03.720 --> 25:05.200
and find the former lord's spirit.

25:05.280 --> 25:06.840
Then I can ask him in person.

25:08.920 --> 25:10.280
However,

25:11.120 --> 25:13.040
the Illuminating Flower
that can awaken spirits

25:13.120 --> 25:14.960
has been extinct for millennia.

25:15.680 --> 25:17.160
I can't do it

25:17.240 --> 25:18.920
without an Illuminating Flower.

25:21.240 --> 25:23.200
If it hadn't been extinct

25:23.280 --> 25:24.600
and everyone used it to go to talk

25:24.680 --> 25:26.240
to their deceased loved ones,

25:26.320 --> 25:28.800
then Oblivion River
would be livelier than Haishi.

25:29.800 --> 25:30.640
Besides,

25:31.200 --> 25:32.640
forget a living Illuminating Flower.

25:32.720 --> 25:34.040
Even a withered one

25:34.120 --> 25:36.680
is a precious collectible item.

25:36.760 --> 25:38.640
It's worth thousands of spirit stones.

25:38.720 --> 25:39.880
A withered one?

25:41.560 --> 25:44.080
Jieli, do you know where to find
a withered Illuminating Flower?

25:44.160 --> 25:45.040
What are you going to do?

25:45.120 --> 25:47.280
Just tell me if you know.

25:48.360 --> 25:49.640
Silent Moon Palace has one.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.920
When Xunfeng was the Moon Supreme,

25:53.000 --> 25:54.200
he missed his father,

25:54.280 --> 25:56.240
so he searched for an Illuminating Flower.

25:56.320 --> 25:58.720
Someone presented him
with a withered Illuminating Flower.

25:58.800 --> 26:00.200
It's in the Spiritual Treasures Pavilion.

26:01.280 --> 26:03.040
Let's go there now and look for it.

26:03.120 --> 26:04.200
Let's go.

26:04.280 --> 26:05.120
Don't bother.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.800
I've already stolen it.

26:09.080 --> 26:10.440
Can you give it to me?

26:11.040 --> 26:12.960
It's just a dead flower.

26:13.040 --> 26:13.960
What's the point?

26:14.040 --> 26:15.400
I have a use for it.

26:15.480 --> 26:16.440
Give it to me.

26:16.520 --> 26:17.760
No.

26:17.840 --> 26:19.120
It's worth a lot of money.

26:22.560 --> 26:23.480
No.

26:49.200 --> 26:50.520
I told you.

26:50.600 --> 26:52.440
This is an Illuminating Flower,

26:52.520 --> 26:54.160
a rare treasure of the three realms.

26:54.720 --> 26:57.080
It's not like the common grass
at Arbiter Hall.

26:57.160 --> 26:58.400
It's not that easy to revive.

26:59.360 --> 27:00.520
Why don't you give it back to me?

27:00.600 --> 27:01.960
I can sell it for a lot of money.

27:04.480 --> 27:06.320
Ever since I met you,

27:06.400 --> 27:07.880
my fortune hasn't been good.

27:09.080 --> 27:11.240
I've even revived a Seven Emotions Tree.

27:11.320 --> 27:13.200
Why can't I save it?

27:14.160 --> 27:15.080
I'll try again.

28:00.080 --> 28:02.200
Why are you still trying?

28:12.040 --> 28:14.080
How long has it been?

28:18.920 --> 28:20.760
Your wound split open. Didn't you notice?

28:20.840 --> 28:23.200
- I want to try one last time.
- Stop it, Orchid.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.800
How many times have you tried?

28:27.000 --> 28:28.440
Enough. Listen to me.

28:28.520 --> 28:30.080
Do you want to get yourself killed?

28:30.160 --> 28:31.680
Are you insane?

28:31.760 --> 28:33.880
Jieli, look.

28:34.720 --> 28:35.600
It's alive.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.840
The Illuminating Flower is alive.

28:39.200 --> 28:40.440
It really is alive.

28:41.280 --> 28:42.480
How is this possible?

28:45.480 --> 28:46.560
I know.

28:46.640 --> 28:47.600
It's the blood.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.360
I see.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.760
The Illuminating Flower lives on blood.

29:38.520 --> 29:40.160
The river's undercurrents are as dangerous

29:40.240 --> 29:41.240
and sharp as a blade.

29:41.320 --> 29:43.320
If you aren't careful,
you won't be returning.

29:43.840 --> 29:44.880
Do you really want to go?

29:47.520 --> 29:48.360
Jieli.

29:51.000 --> 29:52.240
Cloud Shadow Mirror.

30:02.680 --> 30:04.000
Orchid.

30:04.920 --> 30:06.320
Have you thought about it?

30:06.400 --> 30:08.320
Even if you reach the Return to Ruin Realm

30:08.400 --> 30:09.720
and find the former Moon Supreme,

30:09.800 --> 30:11.600
he has been dead for millennia.

30:11.680 --> 30:14.080
He may have already forgotten the past.

30:14.160 --> 30:15.480
Or maybe

30:15.560 --> 30:17.480
he was just a cruel and heartless father.

30:17.560 --> 30:20.240
You won't find
the answers you're looking for.

30:22.200 --> 30:23.360
Jieli.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.840
I've already considered

30:24.920 --> 30:26.280
everything you said.

30:26.360 --> 30:28.040
But I'm still going.

30:29.120 --> 30:31.520
Dongfang Qingcang is already guilty
of killing his father.

30:31.600 --> 30:33.800
Now, he insists on executing Xunfeng.

30:34.680 --> 30:35.960
The world will think

30:36.040 --> 30:37.600
that he's killing his brother

30:37.680 --> 30:39.880
and is going to repeat
what he did to his father.

30:40.560 --> 30:42.920
I can't let him
be misunderstood like this.

30:43.480 --> 30:45.040
As long as there is a glimmer of hope,

30:45.120 --> 30:46.280
I won't give up.

30:50.920 --> 30:52.520
I know you're worried about me.

30:53.800 --> 30:55.200
But I can't think

30:55.800 --> 30:57.760
of any other way.

30:58.800 --> 31:00.080
Who says I'm worried about you?

31:00.920 --> 31:02.680
If you die in Oblivion River,

31:02.760 --> 31:04.600
I'm afraid no one will pay your debt.

31:04.680 --> 31:06.120
You can rest assured.

31:06.200 --> 31:07.600
When I come back,

31:07.680 --> 31:10.200
I'll pay off all the debt I owe you.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.520
You must be careful.

31:38.600 --> 31:40.160
Don't get swept away by the turbulence.

31:41.480 --> 31:42.400
I know.

31:42.480 --> 31:44.120
This stuff must be very expensive.

31:44.200 --> 31:46.120
I can't afford to pay if I lose it.

31:46.200 --> 31:47.600
But Jieli, think about it.

31:48.360 --> 31:49.600
Without the Cloud Shadow Mirror,

31:49.680 --> 31:51.200
even if I see the former Moon Supreme,

31:51.280 --> 31:52.640
I won't remember what he says.

31:52.720 --> 31:54.680
So I will hold on tightly to it.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.640
Are you an idiot?

31:57.400 --> 31:58.440
I meant you.

31:59.400 --> 32:00.960
Don't get swept away by the turbulence.

32:04.000 --> 32:04.960
Don't worry.

33:35.560 --> 33:37.480
My lord, it's time for the execution.

33:37.560 --> 33:38.760
Let's go to the execution site.

33:57.640 --> 33:58.760
It has been four hours.

33:58.840 --> 34:00.280
Why isn't she back yet?

34:01.480 --> 34:02.600
Orchid.

34:06.880 --> 34:07.720
My lord.

34:07.800 --> 34:08.880
Where is she?

34:09.480 --> 34:10.320
She's…

34:37.159 --> 34:38.679
Are these all spirits?

34:40.320 --> 34:41.800
This is the Return to Ruin Realm.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.720
Are you

35:17.560 --> 35:18.920
the former Moon Supreme?

35:47.880 --> 35:48.920
Who told you to come here?

35:49.000 --> 35:50.120
Go back.

35:51.880 --> 35:53.360
I'm not done asking yet.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.160
What do you want to ask?

35:56.160 --> 35:58.480
I want to ask your father
why he treated you that way--

35:58.560 --> 35:59.880
It's not your place to ask.

36:26.080 --> 36:27.880
This is my dead father.

36:30.000 --> 36:32.000
How imperious he was back then.

36:32.880 --> 36:35.240
Now, there is only a pathetic spirit left.

36:38.880 --> 36:39.720
No need to ask.

36:40.440 --> 36:41.720
I don't want to know

36:42.520 --> 36:43.880
anything about him.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.000
Let's go.

36:49.080 --> 36:50.240
You said he didn't love you.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.440
Why did he keep your zither?

36:51.520 --> 36:53.680
His own hands destroyed my zither!

37:25.600 --> 37:27.200
You trespassed into the forbidden place.

37:27.280 --> 37:28.520
That's right.

37:29.560 --> 37:30.920
If I hadn't gone there,

37:31.560 --> 37:32.880
no one would have ever known

37:32.960 --> 37:34.160
where he hid the zither.

37:38.120 --> 37:38.960
Big Blockhead,

37:39.680 --> 37:41.200
I'm already here.

37:41.280 --> 37:42.960
Just let me ask.

37:43.640 --> 37:45.320
Whether you want to kill me, hurt me,

37:45.400 --> 37:47.120
or pull out my tongue,

37:47.200 --> 37:48.640
do it after we get back.

37:48.720 --> 37:49.640
All right?

37:50.480 --> 37:51.320
I told you.

37:52.440 --> 37:53.400
There is no need to ask.

37:54.800 --> 37:55.800
Let's go.

38:43.080 --> 38:44.560
Former Moon Supreme Lord.

38:50.000 --> 38:51.880
How long have I been here?

38:53.360 --> 38:54.440
Thirty thousand years.

38:55.240 --> 38:56.440
Thirty thousand years.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.760
Thirty thousand years.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.000
Who are you?

39:10.080 --> 39:11.400
I am…

39:14.840 --> 39:16.720
Your son sent me here.

39:18.640 --> 39:19.680
Qingcang?

39:22.920 --> 39:25.960
Has he razed the Fairy Realm

39:26.720 --> 39:28.720
and restored the Moon Tribe?

39:32.840 --> 39:34.120
This is

39:34.680 --> 39:36.360
all he cares about.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.520
Former Moon Supreme Lord,

39:41.360 --> 39:42.720
do you recognize this zither?

39:45.320 --> 39:47.120
Of course I do.

39:48.320 --> 39:50.720
Then were you the one
who repaired this zither?

40:19.880 --> 40:20.880
Qingcang

40:23.640 --> 40:26.080
gave it to me as a birthday gift.

40:28.200 --> 40:29.160
But I…

40:31.600 --> 40:33.320
But I destroyed it.

40:37.720 --> 40:40.080
I was unbearably saddened.

40:40.160 --> 40:41.480
Lies!

40:48.400 --> 40:49.920
If you couldn't bear it,

40:50.000 --> 40:51.520
why did you destroy it?

40:53.360 --> 40:54.560
Qingcang.
